<title>ROMANIA: Romanian leu 5,016 to dollar for Jan 20 - BNR.</title>
<headline>Romanian leu 5,016 to dollar for Jan 20 - BNR.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Romania's National Bank (BNR) announced the leu's reference rate weaker at 5,016 to the dollar for January 20.</p>
<p>This reference rate was set on Thursday as a weighted average based on daily reports of foreign exchange operators. It is a guidance rate used for statistical accounting purposes.</p>
<p>The leu's reference rate set on Wednesday for January 17 to 19 is 4,858 to the dollar. It was 4,771 on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Bucharest Newsroom 40-1 3120264</p>
